## ⚡ Wiring & Pinout Quick Reference

### Stepper Motor to Driver Mapping (Standard RAMPS / CNC Shield / Custom Bridge)

| Joint | Axis ID | Motion Role | Gear Type | Driver Step Pin | Driver Dir Pin | Driver Enable Pin |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **J1** | Base Yaw | Base Rotation ($\pm 170^\circ$) | Planetary Reduction | Step 1 | Dir 1 | Enable (Common) |
| **J2** | Shoulder | Lower Arm Pitch ($-60^\circ$ to $+120^\circ$) | Dual-Stage Gear | Step 2 | Dir 2 | Enable (Common) |
| **J3** | Elbow | Forearm Pitch ($\pm 110^\circ$) | Planetary Reduction | Step 3 | Dir 3 | Enable (Common) |
| **J4** | Wrist Roll | Forearm Torsion ($\pm 180^\circ$) | Direct / Planetary | Step 4 | Dir 4 | Enable (Common) |
| **J5** | Wrist Pitch | Flange Tilt ($\pm 90^\circ$) | Bevel / Pivot | Step 5 | Dir 5 | Enable (Common) |
| **J6** | Tool Roll | End-Effector Rotation ($\pm 360^\circ$) | Direct Drive | Step 6 | Dir 6 | Enable (Common) |

